---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Run Containers on Bare Metal or VMs with MOJO Platform — Metify" description="MOJO Platform makes deploying containers on bare metal or VMs seamless, addressing the growing enterprise need for on-premises container infrastructure.">
  <article class="py-24 bg-brand-darker">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <a href="/blog" class="text-brand-green text-sm font-semibold hover:underline mb-8 inline-flex items-center">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" /></svg>
        Back to Blog
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-white mt-4 mb-4">Run Containers on Bare Metal or VM's with MOJO Platform</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8">March 11, 2024</p>
      <img src="/images/blog/Bare-Metal.jpg" alt="Bare Metal Server" class="w-full rounded-xl mb-12" />

      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8">According to a recent IDC survey, the enterprise market is roughly split 50/50 between running containers on-premises versus in the cloud. MOJO makes deployment seamless regardless of your preferred approach.</p>

        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">Container orchestration platforms like Kubernetes, Red Hat OpenShift, and Google Anthos have transformed how enterprises deploy and manage applications. But the underlying infrastructure — whether bare metal servers or virtual machines — still needs to be provisioned, configured, and maintained.</p>

        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">MOJO Platform bridges this gap by automating the entire bare metal lifecycle: from initial discovery and BIOS configuration, through OS installation and Kubernetes node preparation, to ongoing firmware management and compliance monitoring.</p>

        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">Whether you're running containers directly on bare metal for maximum performance, or provisioning VMs that host your container workloads, MOJO provides a single pane of glass for managing your physical infrastructure.</p>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/trial" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 bg-brand-green text-brand-darker font-bold rounded-lg hover:bg-brand-green-dark transition-all">
            Download Free Trial
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
